  "purpose": "定义设计冻结语义审查必须直接读取并核对的根事实、方法、研究主体、规范契约和威胁模型；不能只审查由这些依据派生的治理摘要。",
  "selection_rules": {
    "artifact_sort": "path_lexicographic_ascending",
    "hash_algorithm": "sha256_file_bytes",
    "path_base": "scope=project uses the investment-discipline-system root; scope=repository uses the Git top-level",
    "required_semantics": "required=true 表示该路径必须存在、SHA-256 必须匹配当前候选，而且语义审查的 reviewed_files 必须包含它。",
    "research_expansion": "governance/AI_PROJECT_RESEARCH_REGISTER_V1.json 的全部 primary_artifacts 必须逐项出现在 artifacts 中并使用相同 path/sha256。",
    "self_reference": "本清单不把自身放入 artifacts，避免递归哈希；它必须由上层冻结文件边界和 frozen bundle 单独内容寻址。"
  },
  "excluded_categories": [
    {
      "category": "implementation_and_verifier_scope",
      "examples": [
        "acceptance/",
        "governance_tests/",
        "scripts/",
        "src/",
        "tests/",
        "web/"
      ],
      "reason": "这些路径由实施目标和代码审查范围单独自动展开；本清单只定义语义 ground truth，不能替代实现、测试和验证器审查。"
    },
    {
      "category": "mutable_project_state",
      "examples": [
        "LOOP_RUN_LOG.md",
        "ROADMAP.md",
        "STATUS.md",
        "TASK_BOARD.md"
      ],
      "reason": "这些文件表达当前进度或计划，会随工作推进变化，不作为设计语义的内容寻址根事实。"
    },
    {
      "category": "runtime_outputs_and_private_state",
      "examples": [
        "backups/",
        "evidence/",
        "prototype/data/runs/",
        "runtime SQLite databases"
      ],
      "reason": "运行结果、条件证据、备份和私人状态有独立候选绑定、保密、保留和恢复规则，不进入设计 ground-truth 清单。"
    },
    {
      "category": "self_reference",
      "examples": [
        "governance/GROUND_TRUTH_MANIFEST_V1.json"
      ],
      "reason": "自包含 SHA-256 会形成递归；清单本身由外层冻结包寻址。"
    }
  ],
